1
00:00:00,549 --> 00:00:01,889
(Raj:)Can I make you breakfast?

2
00:00:02,051 --> 00:00:05,221
(Raj:)Admiral Ackbar's Snack Bar
is open for business.

3
00:00:06,288 --> 00:00:08,398
(Penny:)No, thanks. Leonard and I
are just going to the funeral.

4
00:00:08,557 --> 00:00:10,467
You sure? Not even coffee?

5
00:00:10,626 --> 00:00:12,336
(Howard:)We have R2-Decaf.

6
00:00:13,929 --> 00:00:16,269
(Howard:)Maybe a nice Cafe Au Leia?

7
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:19,073
(Raj:)And if you're not
in the mood for coffee,

8
00:00:19,235 --> 00:00:21,305
(Raj:)I can always make you
a Chai Tea-3PO.

9
00:00:22,138 --> 00:00:25,418
(Penny:)I get it-- like C-3PO.

10
00:00:25,574 --> 00:00:28,074
(Penny:)What happened to me?

11
00:00:29,111 --> 00:00:32,321
-Hey, Sheldon, you want anything?
-No, thank you.

12
00:00:32,481 --> 00:00:34,021
(Howard:)You're being so quiet.

13
00:00:34,183 --> 00:00:37,493
(Howard:)Are you upset
or are you just rebooting?

14
00:00:37,653 --> 00:00:39,293
(Sheldon:)I'm fine.

15
00:00:39,455 --> 00:00:42,195
(Penny:)Sweetie, are you sure you don't want
to come with us to the funeral?

16
00:00:42,358 --> 00:00:45,498
(Sheldon:)I appreciate the offer,
but Arthur is gone

17
00:00:45,661 --> 00:00:47,371
(Sheldon:)and there's nothing
I can do about it.

18
00:00:47,530 --> 00:00:49,840
(Sheldon:)When Darth Vader
struck down Obi-Wan,

19
00:00:49,999 --> 00:00:52,979
(Sheldon:)did Luke cry like a baby
and go to his funeral?

20
00:00:53,135 --> 00:00:54,675
(Penny:)No, he blew up the Death Star.

21
00:00:54,837 --> 00:00:56,647
Why do I know this?!

22
00:00:57,773 --> 00:01:00,023
(Sheldon:)Arthur Jeffries was a scientist.

